 GRAM 🌱 Whether you’re a seasoned plant parent or just looking to grow
  your collection\, join us at the Manheim Township Public Library for a do
 uble dose of plant fun! Start by refreshing your garden at our community p
 lant swap\, and stay right after for an exciting\, free gardening program 
 to learn the secrets hidden in your landscape. How the Swap Works: Give On
 e\, Get One: Bring a healthy\, pest-free plant (potted or a rooted cutting
  in a jar) to the swap table and take home a new green friend! 🌿🪴 Sh
 are the Knowledge: Feel free to attach care instructions or ID tags so the
  new owner knows how to help their new sprout thrive. Branch Out: Meet fel
 low local gardeners and swap expert tips along with your plants! Bonus Pro
 gram Right After! Stick around immediately following the swap for The Trea
 chery of Botany: Poisonous Garden Plants\, a free\, eye-opening session on
  identifying and managing hidden plant hazards in your landscape. Bring a 
 plant\, pick up a new favorite\, and gain the know-how to keep your botani
 cal sanctuary thriving and safe!\n\nPrice: Free\n\nSchedule listed: Mon\, 
